'''''Dicranum viride''''' is a species of [[moss]] belonging to the family [[Dicranaceae]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web|title=Dicranum viride Lindberg, 1863|url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2675421|website=www.gbif.org|access-date=14 February 2021|language=en}}</ref>

It is native to [[Northern Hemisphere]],<ref name="GBIF" /> including Japan.<ref name="Ohmura2016">{{cite journal |last1=Ohmura |first1=Yoshihito |last2=Mayrhofer |first2=Helmut |title=''Protothelenella sphinctrinoides'' (''Protothelenellaceae'') New to Japan and New Chemical Features for Several Species in the Genus |journal=Herzogia |date=2016 |volume=29 |issue=1 |pages=137-142 |doi=10.13158/heia.29.1.2016.137}}</ref>

